---
config:
  startOnLoad: false
  theme: base
  htmlLabels: false
  fontFamily: Arial, Microsoft YaHei, Noto Serif CJK SC, sans-serif
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 14px
    primaryColor: "#e9f2fc"
    primaryBorderColor: "#296bb7"
    primaryTextColor: "#333333"
    lineColor: "#0b0b0b"
  themeCSS: |
    .node text,
    .nodeLabel,
    .label text {
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .node rect,
    .flowchart-link {
      stroke-width: 1px;
    }
---

flowchart TD
    A[可微的网络结构] --> F[梯度提供局部更新方向]
    B[高维参数空间] --> G[需要同时考虑大量局部方向]
    C[过参数化] --> H[好解可能不是唯一的孤立点]
    D[Mini-batch SGD] --> I[优化过程带有随机性]
    E[真实数据具有结构] --> J[模型不需要拟合整个输入空间]
    F --> K[神经网络训练在实践中变得可行]
    G --> K
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K
